  "title": "Autograph | Motion Design &amp; Visual Effects Tool",
  "paragraphs": [
    "What is Maxon Autograph?",
    "#Headline{ font-size:28px !important; line-height: 2.1rem; } #Copy{ font-size:15px !important; line-height: 1.5rem; }",
    "Autograph is a software solution that combines professional tools for motion graphics, VFX/compositing, and 2D/3D projects across industries. Optimized for speed, Autograph uses its GPU-powered engine and extensible capabilities to provide creative tools for anyone searching for a unified toolset.",
    "Explore the creative possibilities with Autograph!",
    "Equipped with a powerful shape engine, convenient motion paths, and a simplified workflow, Autograph provides enhanced animation tools for all types of projects.",
    "Boost your compositing and VFX projects by quickly loading and layering 3D assets, 2D animations, video effects, looks, object animations, and camera moves – all with reactive feedback.",
    "Get the look you want with dozens of native GPU-optimized effects (Modifiers). Autograph also supports OpenFX plugins, Shadertoy, as well as multi-channel EXR, Photoshop layers, and ProRes. Work confidently with ACES and OCIO workflows for high-quality imaging pipelines.",
    "Take your animations to the next level with Autograph’s precise rotoscoping toolkit as well as 2D and planar tracking.",
    "Access Universe and Red Giant OFX tools directly from Autograph’s Modifier list or through the integrated Maxon Studio plugin page.",
    "Autograph supports third-party OpenFX plugins, including RE:Vision Effects, BorisFX, and Digital Anarchy.",
    "Autograph delivers powerful tools for Japan’s animation and compositing industry, with native support for vertical text and Japanese characters. A new Edge Smoother Modifier to instantly smooth aliased edges on graphic elements and an upgraded Forward method for Vector Blur streamline modern anime and CG compositing workflows.",
    "Dive into Autograph’s complete 3D environment based on Pixar’s OpenUSD. Create and import complex scenes and render and composite in 2D on the fly.",
    "Watch the Maxon Autograph Getting Started series for a quick overview of the fundamentals of motion graphics and visual effects in the program.",
    "Autograph is a free motion graphics and VFX/compositing application. Use it within your workflow to create stunning motion graphics like animated logos, text, shapes, and transitions. Choose from hundreds of compatible effects to add that special touch to your shots. Easily combine 2D and 3D assets together to bring your projects to life in a unified workflow. Connect external data to projects and automate changing content. Render the same project in multiple formats for use across social media channels. Learn more about Autograph’s features here .",
    "Absolutely! You can download and use Autograph for free here .",
    "Yes! You can access all Universe plugins and Red Giant OFX tools (license required) directly within Autograph from the list of Modifiers. You can also access them from the integrated Maxon Studio plugin page.",
    "Learn all about how to get started with Autograph here .",
    "Autograph is free for everyone!",
    "Some tools have been renamed, such as the Cloner (previously Instancer) to unify naming across Maxon and avoid confusion. Certain features are no longer available for the time being as we make adjustments and continue development. You can now access Universe and all Red Giant OFX plugins directly within Autograph.",
    "At this time, Autograph continues to use Filament, a high-quality, real-time, physically-based renderer.",
    "Autograph also supports third-party OpenFX plugins, beginning with RE:Vision Effects, BorisFX, and Digital Anarchy, whose plugins are available directly through their own marketplaces.",
    "If you have any additional questions, please don’t hesitate to reach us. We’re here to help! Support Center",
    "Autograph is available on Windows and macOS and is designed to work even on less powerful devices, maximizing the potential of all workstations. For more information, check out our list of system requirements .",
    "Get Maxon Autograph Free",
    "STAY CONNECTED #text-headline{ text-align: center; font-family: 'Rajdhani'; font-weight: 600; font-size: 50px; line-height: 3.5rem; } @media screen and (max-width: 800px) { #text-headline{ display: flex; justify-content: center; font-size: 50px; line-height: 3.5rem; } } @media screen and (max-width: 640px) { #text-headline{ display: flex; justify-content: center; font-size: 36px; line-height: 2.5rem; } }",
    "Their success tells the story of our products value."
  ],
