    "Full 3D environment",
    "2169545",
    "<a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/product-detail/autograph/key-features?categories=2169232\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">View all features</a>",
    "2169547",
    "2169548",
    "2169549",
    "USD standard",
    "2169550",
    "<p>Dive into Autograph’s complete 3D environment based on Pixar’s OpenUSD. Create and import complex scenes and render and composite in 2D on the fly.</p>",
    "2169551",
    "2169552",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Autograph/3D_USD_Standard.jpg",
    "3D_USD_Standard.jpg",
    "2169553",
    "2169554",
    "2169555",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Autograph/3D_combine_2D3D.png",
    "3D_combine_2D3D.png",
    "Combine 2D and 3D in the same space",
    "Quickly and easily assemble visually complex images combining 2D and 3D assets directly in the Timeline. Render everything in one place with a specially designed unified workflow.",
    "2169556",
    "2169557",
    "2169558",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Autograph/3D-composition_as_texture.jpg",
    "3D-composition_as_texture.jpg",
    "Use compositions as textures",
    "Add textures to 3D models using any image or composition created or imported in Autograph.",
    "2169559",
    "2169560",
    "2169561",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Autograph/3D_rendering_new.jpg",
    "3D_rendering_new.jpg",
    "3D rendering",
    "Render your projects with Filament, a high-quality, real-time, physically-based renderer.",
    "2169562",
    "2171244",
    "2171245",
    "2171247",
    "Getting started",
    "2171248",
    "<p>Watch the Maxon Autograph Getting Started series for a quick overview of the fundamentals of motion graphics and visual effects in the program.</p>",
    "2171249",
    "<a href=\"https://cineversity.maxon.net/en/series/getting-started-with-autograph?tutorial=getting-start-in-autograph-introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watch now</a>",
    "2171251",
    "2171252",
    "2171253",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Autograph/Autograph-Tutorial_image.jpeg",
    "Autograph-Tutorial_image.jpeg",
    "2169563",
    "2169564",
    "2169566",
    "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "contentBuilder_accordion_BlockType",
    "2169567",
    "What is Autograph?",
    "contentBuilder_pane_BlockType",
    "2169569",
    "<p>\r\n    Autograph is a free motion graphics and VFX/compositing application. Use it within your workflow to create stunning motion graphics like animated logos, text, shapes, and transitions. Choose from hundreds of compatible effects to add that special touch to your shots. Easily combine 2D and 3D assets together to bring your projects to life in a unified workflow. Connect external data to projects and automate changing content. Render the same project in multiple formats for use across social media channels. <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/product-detail/autograph/key-features\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Learn more about Autograph’s features here</strong></a>.\r\n</p>",
    "2169570",
    "Is Autograph really free?",
    "2169572",
    "<p>\r\n    Absolutely! You can download and use Autograph for free <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/downloads#autograph\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>here</strong></a>.\r\n</p>",
    "2169573",
    "Can I use other Maxon software with Autograph?",
    "2169575",
    "<p>Yes! You can access all Universe plugins and Red Giant OFX tools (license required) directly within Autograph from the list of Modifiers. You can also access them from the integrated Maxon Studio plugin page.</p>",
    "2169576",
    "Do you offer Autograph training and courses?",
    "2171254",
    "<p>\r\n    Learn all about how to get started with Autograph <a href=\"https://cineversity.maxon.net/en/series/getting-started-with-autograph?tutorial=getting-start-in-autograph-introduction\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>here</strong></a>.\r\n</p>",
    "2171352",
    "Do you offer student/education licensing?",
    "2171354",
    "<p>\r\n    Autograph is free for everyone!\r\n</p>",
    "2169694",
    "I was a previous Autograph user and have noticed some changes.",
    "2169696",
    "<p>Some tools have been renamed, such as the Cloner (previously Instancer) to unify naming across Maxon and avoid confusion. Certain features are no longer available for the time being as we make adjustments and continue development. You can now access Universe and all Red Giant OFX plugins directly within Autograph.</p>",
    "2169582",
    "Does Autograph use Redshift?",
    "2169584",
    "<p>At this time, Autograph continues to use Filament, a high-quality, real-time, physically-based renderer.</p>",
    "2172508",
    "Does Autograph integrate with third party VFX plugins?",
    "2172510",
    "<p>Autograph also supports third-party OpenFX plugins, beginning with RE:Vision Effects, BorisFX, and Digital Anarchy, whose plugins are available directly through their own marketplaces.</p>",
    "2169585",
    "Have more questions?",
    "2169587",
    "<p>If you have any additional questions, please don’t hesitate to reach us. We’re here to help! <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/support-center\">Support Center</a></p>",
    "2175906",
    "Technical requirements",
    "2175908",
    "<p>\r\n    Autograph is available on Windows and macOS and is designed to work even on less powerful devices, maximizing the potential of all workstations. For more information, <a href=\"https://support.maxon.net/hc/en-us/articles/16797414314012-System-Requirements-for-Maxon-Products\" target=\"_blank\">check out our list of system requirements</a>.\r\n</p>",
